    "name": "Bulk Red Beets - 5lb. bag",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Beets are a vibrantly colored root vegetable known for its earthy flavor, high nutrient content, and antioxidant properties.&nbsp;Rich in vitamins, minerals, fiber, and compounds called&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=ba24c2d2484ecd3d&amp;q=betalains&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjrmunL0KuPAxX9ke4BHX2aAm0QxccNegQIDBAB&amp;mstk=AUtExfC2F0-QPMxBneNQg4txMByQojg91q5IdD-3kpk8EHUKZlCa1MT_BTCeE2g1EqbPtuDaOofEXG9iiU3UFdx9QB0JbIhQuqethzQ577VmUIMmarEjT1k38ICjo9j1LpGH2DM&amp;csui=3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"lexical-text-editor--link\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">betalains</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">,&nbsp;red beets support overall health by improving blood flow, aiding liver and heart function, and boosting digestion.&nbsp;They can be enjoyed raw, steamed, roasted, or boiled, and are a versatile ingredient in salads, juices, dips, and other dishes.</span></p>",
